OL,3,GNEWSACadet security boosted at
OL,4,ACrowborough asylum camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to put up security fences has
OL,7,Fbegun at two Ministry of Defence
OL,8,Fbuildings used by cadets in East
OL,9,FSussex.
OL,11,FThe work is being carried out after
OL,12,Fplans to use Crowborough Training Camp
OL,13,Fto house as many as 540 asylum seekers
OL,14,Fwere announced last year.
OL,16,FThey started being housed there in
OL,17,FJanuary and the Home Office wants to
OL,18,Fuse the site until 2030.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
