OL,3,GNEWSACadet security boosted at
OL,4,ACrowborough asylum camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cadets were forced to leave the
OL,7,Fsite because of the asylum plans in
OL,8,FDecember last year though the council
OL,9,Fsaid they began "slowly returning" in
OL,10,FJune.
